/-!
# The certificate coefficients grouped by signature

`certGroupSigs` are the 272 even-part signatures of the certificate basis in the order in
which they appear contiguously in `certBasis`, and `certGroupCoefs i a` is the coefficient
of `(a, certGroupSigs i)` (so the coefficient vector of the `i`-th group is the list of the
coefficients of `(0, α_i), (1, α_i), ..., (25 - |α_i|, α_i)`).
-/

namespace Commons.NumberTheory.MaynardSieve

noncomputable section

